  "title": "Shelby's Magic Potion",
  "description": "Lemon lime soda is flavored with drink mix, and poured over ice cream so that it bubbles up. This is a fun drink to make with a group of children. My daughter's Brownie Troop loved it. Use any flavor of drink mix that you like!",
